   },
   "description": "Store and sync game data at global scale.\n\nCloud Firestore is a flexible NoSQL document database that lets you easily store, sync, and query data for your games - at global scale.\n\nFirestore supports a million players connected simultaneously with a guaranteed uptime of 5 nines for multi-region instances. That's less than 5 minutes of downtime a year!\n\nWith Cloud Firestore, your players can access and make changes to their data at any time, even when they're offline.",
